      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sadly with the uprise of people stealing avatars... this might have to come to pass.  Ideally it would be great if stealing were harder to perform but... let's face it, it will never be fully prevented.  I have my own character of my own creation, I do not want people going around as my own identity.\n\nIt's one thing to modify an avatar that is pubic, but to have one that is meant to be used as one's self...  so while I do like to show off my avatar, and have people see -me- instead of generic robot... especially since I seem to make friends because of my avatar c.c;  but... I really don't want my identity stolen!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
