      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is an really good idea for something you can turn on and off in the settings. So that people that arent your friends just see's the generic ghostly robot avatar like if safety all avatars blocked is on.\nThat way the hackers wont even see your avatar to begin with and wont get anything in their cache.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
