      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5b44f9cc8b5c2d06aa4307e9",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I strongly agree with this suggestion. I was about to post about this my self. I think this would be extremely beneficial so that only people you trust are able to load and see your avatars.\nPeople such as your friends, and people to who you manually enable permissions.\nThis would allow by choice people avoid being harassed by strangers in public because of their avatars and still be able to enjoy them around people they trust.\nA much better alternative to being always couped up hiding in private worlds out of fear.\nHaving it as an option where when \"toggled\" would work as a whitelist of sorts where only your friends and people you toggled permission on via the quick  menu can load and see, and for the rest of the users would only see \"Fallback\" avatars instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-07-10T18:24:12.644Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "What if there was a way to set it so your avatar was only viewable by friends so other players couldn't steal it or rip it from cache using all the publicly available tools floating around. I'd greatly appreciate this.",
